    <briefdescription>
<para>Abstract interface for querying host hardware facts. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>The default production implementation reads /proc/cpuinfo, /proc/meminfo, and uname(2) on POSIX systems, and the Win32 API on Windows. Tests inject a mock that returns canned values without touching the real OS. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
